    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/90d4f9d7449b191cdc0cf6a5e8b7d6f5.poster.avif?t=1753663378\" width=582 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/90d4f9d7449b191cdc0cf6a5e8b7d6f5.webm?t=1753663378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/90d4f9d7449b191cdc0cf6a5e8b7d6f5.mp4?t=1753663378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A retro-styled RPG, set in a universe hurdled toward machine singularity.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Inspired by retro sci-fi, cyberpunk anime, and classic RPGs.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel art drawn in the style of SNES </strong>/ <strong>PS1.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character-driven stories</strong>; existentialist themes related to AI, simulations, futurism as a religion, dystopian vs utopian paths for technology, digital identity etc.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/23c490b4515c7c64af76e2830bdbb785.poster.avif?t=1753663378\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/23c490b4515c7c64af76e2830bdbb785.apng?t=1753663378\" class=\"bb_img\" width=156 height=141 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate the BOUNTY system</strong>: A numeric representation of how often robots will seek out the player for combat, based on their specific actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inflict</strong> <strong>machine-specific status effects</strong> such as <strong>Short-Circuited (electric stun)</strong> and <strong>VIRUS (confused/berserk behavior) </strong>to disadvantage the robot foes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The player can reprogram some robotic enemies to fight alongside the party\u2014or even upgrade them!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/ff63b55b71b324baf043ecbe46340675.avif?t=1753663378\" data-has-big width=800 height=566 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Join Selva</strong>, </i>a grizzled and Luddite-leaning mercenary, formerly trained to hunt rogue AIs, who is drawn back to the fold amidst increasing social unrest... \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite formerly putting her guns away for a life of leisure and solitude, new events have forced her to reconsider her unfolding destiny in a technocratic future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/d63457f03bb4b24dcd0197fbbd9ee6be.avif?t=1753663378\" data-has-big width=800 height=554 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&amp; Jiro</strong>, <strong>a boy who lived his entire life inside the Aethar Hives</strong>: </i>a largely underground bunker, an AI-governed pseudo-utopia where human life is tightly regulated through immaculate LLMs, VR, utilitarian controls, and emotional suppression in exchange for 'order' and safety.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Other recruits include <strong>Misaki</strong>, <strong>an elderly wanderer and former herbalist</strong>, scouring the toxic surface for untainted seeds, and <strong>Aurum</strong>, <strong>a 'robotic bard' programmed to communicate only through poetry</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/90d4f9d7449b191cdc0cf6a5e8b7d6f5.poster.avif?t=1753663378\" width=582 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/90d4f9d7449b191cdc0cf6a5e8b7d6f5.webm?t=1753663378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/90d4f9d7449b191cdc0cf6a5e8b7d6f5.mp4?t=1753663378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A retro-styled RPG, set in a universe hurdled toward machine singularity.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Inspired by retro sci-fi, cyberpunk anime, and classic RPGs.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel art drawn in the style of SNES </strong>/ <strong>PS1.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character-driven stories</strong>; existentialist themes related to AI, simulations, futurism as a religion, dystopian vs utopian paths for technology, digital identity etc.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/23c490b4515c7c64af76e2830bdbb785.poster.avif?t=1753663378\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/23c490b4515c7c64af76e2830bdbb785.apng?t=1753663378\" class=\"bb_img\" width=156 height=141 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate the BOUNTY system</strong>: A numeric representation of how often robots will seek out the player for combat, based on their specific actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inflict</strong> <strong>machine-specific status effects</strong> such as <strong>Short-Circuited (electric stun)</strong> and <strong>VIRUS (confused/berserk behavior) </strong>to disadvantage the robot foes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The player can reprogram some robotic enemies to fight alongside the party\u2014or even upgrade them!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/ff63b55b71b324baf043ecbe46340675.avif?t=1753663378\" data-has-big width=800 height=566 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Join Selva</strong>, </i>a grizzled and Luddite-leaning mercenary, formerly trained to hunt rogue AIs, who is drawn back to the fold amidst increasing social unrest... \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite formerly putting her guns away for a life of leisure and solitude, new events have forced her to reconsider her unfolding destiny in a technocratic future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758170/extras/d63457f03bb4b24dcd0197fbbd9ee6be.avif?t=1753663378\" data-has-big width=800 height=554 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&amp; Jiro</strong>, <strong>a boy who lived his entire life inside the Aethar Hives</strong>: </i>a largely underground bunker, an AI-governed pseudo-utopia where human life is tightly regulated through immaculate LLMs, VR, utilitarian controls, and emotional suppression in exchange for 'order' and safety.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Other recruits include <strong>Misaki</strong>, <strong>an elderly wanderer and former herbalist</strong>, scouring the toxic surface for untainted seeds, and <strong>Aurum</strong>, <strong>a 'robotic bard' programmed to communicate only through poetry</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
